Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.09,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:13.46,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:19.14,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.97,0:00:25.54,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:31.35,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:37.09,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.69,0:00:42.89,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.09,0:00:48.30,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:01:00.64,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now.\NSpirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.11,0:01:06.12,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.38,0:01:11.56,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:17.93,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:23.90,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.90,0:01:29.31,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may shallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:10.35,Default,,650,0,500,,{\i1\b1}Held in a \N Web of Deception{\i0\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:23.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's more or less the same as the first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.43,0:02:24.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:30.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They all remember seeing the girl, but no one remembers\Nthe most important part; when she disappeared...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.73,0:02:32.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, what's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.61,0:02:35.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I came to pick up some visuals\Nfrom the IR systems around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:37.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but they show nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:38.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Our investigation was fruitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.61,0:02:39.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:45.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Chief and the internal cabinet minister are getting\Ninformation on the situation from former Prime Minister Kanzaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:48.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, don't you think it's similar?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To {\i1}their{\i} criminal method?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:57.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Chief seems to be thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.72,0:03:01.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A person suddenly disappears\Nin the great urban city...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.18,0:03:04.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Blindfolded Ivan"...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:06.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's their old trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:11.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But the one who disappeared was none other\Nthan former Prime Minister Kanzaki's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.90,0:03:14.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He denied the existence of the abduction\Ngroup called Blind Folded Erwin, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:20.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even if it is them, I don't think they'd do something\Nthat is equivalent to strangling themselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:25.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Or it could be someone else's scheme\Nwho wants us to think that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.58,0:03:34.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I hope that it's just a rather complicated\Ncase of running away from home...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:41.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Because I've been hit hard by the media and become\Nbusy in politics, I've only given her a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.09,0:03:46.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Because of your speech denying the mass\Nabductions the year before last, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:47.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.39,0:03:51.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They say that this is the fate of public figures,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.39,0:03:54.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but according to me, the citizens\Nexist because the government does.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:04:00.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At the time, the abduction allegations had backed\NRussia into a diplomatic corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:07.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Because Russia, which was about to sever ties with the\NEU, wanted to form a stronger relationship with Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.29,0:04:13.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Either way, why is there still is\Nno ransom demand from the criminal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.58,0:04:16.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As a matter of fact,\Nalthough this has not been confirmed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:21.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it's possible that the criminal who abducted Reiko-San\Ndidn't know that she was the daughter of a congressman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:24.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In other words...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:27.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Extrapolating from what we know now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:34.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,we think that she was taken by Blind Folded\NErwin, whose existence you deny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:36.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's idiocy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:37.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:44.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Congressman, you denied their existence publicly,\Nbut you know of their actions, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:51.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, I have no comment about what they did in\Nthe past, but I was the one who defended them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:55.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, it seems unlikely that they\Nabducted my daughter by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:05:00.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Northern Mafia is composed of tens of thousands\Nof people from high officials to low-ranked members.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:05.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are most likely people in the lowest\Nranks who do not know of your efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:10.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm quite disappointed with you, to think that\Nyou can only reach that kind of conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.81,0:05:16.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Or perhaps the main government faction\Npressured you to obstruct the investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:19.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kanzaki-San, that's a horrible thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:25.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I understand how you feel, but the Prime Minister is deeply\Nconcerned, which is why he brought Section Nine into this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:27.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wasn't asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.99,0:05:33.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You seem to be having misgivings about\Nmany things, so let me say this clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:38.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I am not concerned with anything other\Nthan getting your daughter back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:50.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:51.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We were listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:55.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Former prime minister Kanzaki\Nseems to be quite paranoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:57.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:06:03.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He had to resign because a family member in\Nthe government party leaked information...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:11.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The northern organ smuggling group are professionals that\Noperate with the implicit consent of their government.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:14.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sure that even Congressman\NKanzaki is aware of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.41,0:06:20.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then it's all the more curious that they abducted\NKanzaki's daughter, since he is their defender.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:22.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you really think her\Nabduction was a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:25.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Though I have no proof, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.59,0:06:28.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even if they are a professional group,\Nin the end they are just a bunch of hoodlums.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:34.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I recently learned that the Northern Mafia\Nhas been having an internal power struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.31,0:06:38.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's possible that she got involved\Nin it for some unknown reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:44.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If it's the former scenario, then it would be bad\Nif the criminals found out that she's Kanzaki's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:46.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If I were a low ranked person...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:50.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, we cannot let that information\Nget to them at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:52.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's what the media control is there for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.91,0:06:57.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In addition, don't let the\Nenemy detect our movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:07:01.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The police have never gone after Blind\NFolded Erwin to this extent before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:03.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're probably off guard for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:09.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, if they find out, they'll probably\Nkill off all the hostages and hide underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:10.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.89,0:07:16.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, it's highly unlikely that they\Nwould send their stock overseas alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.39,0:07:18.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're probably going to process them somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:22.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Investigate the institutions that could do the\Ndismantling, starting with the most likely ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:24.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:26.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The major is so matter-of-fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:49.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:56.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The air quality is bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:08:02.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This will eliminate much of the benefit of gathering\Nclean bodies born after the "Asian Miracle".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.73,0:08:03.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:06.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How many more do we need?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:11.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Will you let me rest for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:14.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll let you have a holiday after\Nthis job is safely completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:17.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll have to quit the business\Nif we don't complete this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.79,0:08:18.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Three more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:21.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Alright, secure them quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:26.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going to prepare to dismantle and\Nship these girl's organs and cyberbrains.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:28.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're going to do them by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:32.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I had the local mafia introduce\Nme to a black-market doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:34.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not that, but my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.89,0:08:35.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:37.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do what you're paid for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:39.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.77,0:08:46.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're Kanzaki's daughter, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:51.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Isn't this the mass abduction\Nthat your father denied?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.99,0:08:58.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When I saw your face I thought this was some kind of\Nmistake, but you heard what that lady said, right!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:00.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's going on!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even if you say so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.55,0:09:13.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, the first entry has come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.55,0:09:14.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:18.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm amazed, where do they get the information?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.43,0:09:21.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The location is virtual\Ncity beta's "tarekomi dera".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.43,0:09:20.35,Default,,0,0,900,,[Translators Note: {\i1\b1}Tarekomi dera{\i0\b0} refers to websites for reporting corporate corruption. It's probably a parody of {\i1\b1}Kakekomi dera{\i0\b0},]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:26.35,Default,,0,0,900,,[literally "run into temple", temples given specials rights to\N protect women during the Edo Era when men had power over women.]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:23.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Checking the response related to the entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:26.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Information leakage into personal\Nsites, confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:27.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:33.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's very likely that the nine great networks\Nleaked it to get past the media agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.15,0:09:37.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's an important piece of information,\Nbut they use tragedies as amusement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:39.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They really piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.03,0:09:42.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, it's not like I didn't expect this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.75,0:09:45.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's the estimated time until the\Ncriminal reaches the sixth level?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:48.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Two hours if we're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:52.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If they perform an AI search,\Nit'll be more like twenty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:55.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Setup a chain reaction failure with the F4 decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:58.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That should give us at least thirty more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:02.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Poor girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:05.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If the Northern Mafia really did abduct\Nher, it's poetic justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:09.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What would he do if she wasn't his daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:12.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't bring your opinions into your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:15.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's just that you personally\Ndon't like Kanzaki, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:19.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think I'm saying what\Nmost citizens are thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.45,0:10:22.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's going to happen to\Nthose who were abducted before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:26.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Your feelings are understandable, but right\Nnow think of how the victims are feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:32.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's a fact that 29 young women have been confirmed\Nmissing in this city alone over the past three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:36.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not rare for minors to run away these days,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:41.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but there's already been some sort of\Ninvestigation started for 28 out of 29 of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:47.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Doesn't so many girls from stable households\Ndisappearing just reek of the Northern Mafia?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:01.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's common sense to work from the\Nhighest probability to the lowest,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but would they really be hiding\Nin such an easy to find place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:09.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sometimes you open the door and find\Nout that your neighbour is a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.83,0:11:13.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why didn't you bring a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:18.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The boss said that if you give him a fifty percent cut,\Nincluding for the last payment, he'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:20.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:22.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I already sent the last payment to your account!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.05,0:11:24.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:25.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:27.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}...I just told you what my\Nsuperiors told me to tell you.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:26.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.93,0:11:32.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Your planning to make us pay more\Nbecause you know we need it badly, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:36.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Comrades?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:40.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.74,0:11:46.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What the hell is happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:48.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who knows, let's follow them for the time being!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:53.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You go around from the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:15.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, the girl went your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:16.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't let your guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.44,0:12:17.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:39.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bingo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:41.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:12:59.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Throw that arm away immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.35,0:13:31.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,...still alive? Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:33.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What? What a horrible thing to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.35,0:13:36.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For an instant, my family \N flashed before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:37.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm not talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.57,0:13:42.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm talking about the former SVR's old granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.65,0:13:43.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The police?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:45.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When did they start pursuing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:48.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have to get rid of the girls quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:58.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, we've rescued three\Nyoung women that were abducted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:02.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From the women's testimony, it must be\Na mass abduction by the Northern Mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.63,0:14:04.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And what about the congressman's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.72,0:14:07.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The main criminal has her\Nand is fleeing at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.63,0:14:10.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You were tailing them, what the hell were you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:13.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, but we found out who the main criminal is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:15.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's Cruzkowa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:16.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Cruzkowa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.73,0:14:22.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You mean the famous agent who was in the\NRussian Foreign Intelligence Service, SVR?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.61,0:14:29.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, she is a committed nationalist who engaged\Nin covert action in southeast Asia last century.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:30.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Last century, meaning...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:35.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Her age is unknown. She has made herself\Ninto a cyborg and she may look young,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:38.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but deep inside she's probably\Nand old woman close to her 80's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:40.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:41.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:43.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The situation has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:44.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:54.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Congressman, we have discovered the identity\Nof the criminal who abducted your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:55.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.02,0:14:58.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As we suspected, it's the Northern Mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.23,0:15:00.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,...and, what about Reiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:04.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The criminal has her,\Nand is currently on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:08.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about it? How about informing the embassy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:10.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.32,0:15:15.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's a good idea, but what will happen\Nif they deny knowledge? What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:18.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, you police people can't\Nbe depended upon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:22.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can't disagree with that.\NHowever, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.13,0:15:24.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is it? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:28.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're going to use your media power to\Ndo the opposite of what we've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.13,0:15:32.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We've been using the media agreement\Nto try to keep this situation hidden,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:35.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but now we're going to spread information\Nabout the situation throughout the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.22,0:15:37.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:40.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If I do something like that,\Nthe media will have a field day with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.40,0:15:43.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That will certainly destroy my political career!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.81,0:15:50.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The information that has been\Nleaked already may do that anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:55.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, the only thing that maters\Nnow is your daughter's safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:16:02.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The viewers will spread scandalous information through the internet\Nlike wildfire, and the criminal will certainly hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:05.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then your power will work effectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't understand the significance\Nof what you are saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:10.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's right; explain it\Nso that we can understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:15.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The fleeing criminal is,\Nluckily for us, a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:19.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Since our opponent is a professional\Nthis plan becomes effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.39,0:16:22.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You may think this is strange, but even though\Nthe criminal is our enemy, she is a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.77,0:16:28.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,we can place a degree of trust\Nin her behavioural principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:35.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In other words, if the government's dog finds out\Nthat she has the daughter of Congressman Kanzaki,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:37.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the ally of her mother country,\Nthen she'll certainly ask her comrades for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:43.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And while she is thinking of a way to get out of\Nthis, she will most likely not harm your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:49.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For that reason, it is highly desirable that we expose the\Ncurrent situation to the public eye as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:54.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When that happens, there's only\None place the criminal will run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:56.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To the embassy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:17:00.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's all up to you now, Congressman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.10,0:17:07.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa, is the F4 decoy available?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.69,0:17:10.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At the moment it's working on semantic filtering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:14.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Once the Chief gives the order, we'll launch a counter-leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:16.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Initiate the leak at full speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.49,0:17:21.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Chief's strategy really is merciless...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:24.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At this rate, Kanzaki's going\Nto be made a public spectacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:28.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like the same blood runs through his veins as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.17,0:17:29.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A scary thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:35.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, I'm going to follow Cruzkowa,\Nbut we will probably wind up in the same place...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:38.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're right. I'm leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:41.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you mean you can't cooperate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.39,0:17:45.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've made a lot of money for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.98,0:17:46.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.07,0:17:55.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:56.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've got myself into\Nsomewhat of a tight situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.91,0:17:59.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll pay double the amount; I'd\Nlike you take care of the luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:03.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I heard that you got hold of some\Ndangerous luggage without knowing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.87,0:18:07.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you mean? Is that why they are chasing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.17,0:18:11.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What? You haven't even checked the news?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:16.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's full of talk about you; not just on the\Nnine great networks, but even on private sites.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:20.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're saying, "Northern Spy\NRepays Good Deeds with Evil".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.26,0:18:24.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The mass abduction group abducted\Ntheir supporter Kanzaki's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.14,0:18:29.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kanzaki is angry and seems to be blaming the Northern\NMafia, he has laid his political life on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.15,0:18:32.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're in quite dangerous situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.44,0:18:34.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:35.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You listening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.24,0:18:35.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.28,0:18:41.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is there a Kanzaki Reiko in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:43.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:46.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:48.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:18:59.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:19:00.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you Kanzaki Shuzo's daughter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:06.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why is Kanzaki's daughter on our list of targets!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:10.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.65,0:19:11.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:16.69,Default,,0,0,900,,{\i1\b1}It has already been confirmed that...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:22.91,Default,,0,0,900,,{\i1\b1}there have been 29 cases reported of missing\Nyoung women around Kobe Port over the last three days.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.99,0:19:26.70,Default,,0,0,900,,{\i1\b1}The authorities have come to the conclusion\Nthat the abductions were committed by...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:30.92,Default,,0,0,900,,{\i1\b1}former Foreign Intelligence Service secret\Noperations member, Cruzkowa Bosyeltnov.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:36.09,Default,,0,0,900,,{\i1\b1}One of the women that went missing is former\Nprime minister Kanzaki's daughter, Kanzaki Reiko.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:40.80,Default,,0,0,900,,{\i1\b1}Since this is just the tip of the iceberg for the\Nmass abduction group whose existence Kanzaki denied,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:38.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Comrade, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.22,0:19:39.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Something bad happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:42.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I want you to urgently make asylum\Narrangements for one Japanese person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:43.60,Default,,0,0,900,,{\i1\b1}this incident is creating heated\Ndiscussion in various arenas.{\i\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.65,0:19:58.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Right here will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:02.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:11.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.76,0:20:21.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.05,0:20:27.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:37.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like you've been abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.79,0:20:58.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.09,0:21:04.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A granny with too many tricks up her sleeve...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:20.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Congressman, my men have just now\Nsafely recovered your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.61,0:21:23.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:25.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.91,0:21:28.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You should head for the hospital at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:29.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:37.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Aramaki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:38.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:41.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:57.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.10,0:22:01.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come to think of it, Cruzkowa is a sad spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.61,0:22:04.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She lost in the mafia's internal power struggle,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:09.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and was given a target list with Kanzaki's\Ndaughter's name on it without knowing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.62,0:22:16.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,On top of that, she was branded as a traitor and thrown away by\Nthe one whom she swore loyalty to, her comrade in the embassy...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.21,0:22:17.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's probably what happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.21,0:22:21.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, Chief, I'm surprised you came up with a\Nplan like that in the midst of an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:26.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To make him choose between his\Ndaughter's life and his political life...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.13,0:22:33.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Since the Northern Mafia was involved, severing their\Nties to Kanzaki will act as a deterrent to these crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.31,0:22:37.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For that to happen, it was necessary\Nfor Kanzaki himself to admit the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.89,0:22:41.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sure admitting the truth lifted a heavy\Nburden off his shoulders, so it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:45.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's no harm in being appreciated by\Nhim, now is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.64,0:23:19.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:23.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.52,0:23:27.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.82,0:23:30.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.82,0:23:35.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.29,0:23:39.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.71,0:23:42.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.59,0:23:47.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.72,0:23:50.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.43,0:23:55.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.81,0:24:00.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.02,0:24:00.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.73,0:24:03.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.10,0:24:05.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.69,0:24:07.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.69,0:24:10.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.20,0:24:14.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
